            Node("mem_cycleIndependentOn", "Literal SOURCE statement in namespace D5.S3.Geometry.OriginalLabelTwoSum.AllMWheel; proof body is in the source owner. Elaborated telescope and kernel/native/project acceptance are unavailable.", "theorem mem_cycleIndependentOn (m : Nat) (hm : 3 ≤ m) (s : Finset (Label m)) :\n    s ∈ cycleIndependentOn m hm ↔ s ⊆ ground m ∧\n      ∀ e ∈ cycleEdges m hm, ¬ e ⊆ s", DescribeRole.Theorem),
