            Node("cycleIndependentOn_decomposition", "Literal SOURCE statement in namespace D5.S3.Geometry.OriginalLabelTwoSum.AllMWheel; proof body is in the source owner. Elaborated telescope and kernel/native/project acceptance are unavailable.", "theorem cycleIndependentOn_decomposition (m : Nat) (hm : 3 ≤ m) :\n    cycleIndependentOn m hm =\n      ((pathIndependentOn (cyclePath m hm) ∪\n        (pathIndependentOn (cyclePath m hm)).image (insert (firstLabel m hm))) ∪\n        (pathIndependentOn (cyclePathTail m hm)).image (insert (secondLabel m hm))) ∪\n        (pathIndependentOn (cyclePathLast m hm)).image (insert (lastLabel m))", DescribeRole.Theorem),
