            Node("wheelRoot_mem_cycleDual", "Literal SOURCE statement in namespace D5.S3.Geometry.OriginalLabelTwoSum.AllMWheel; proof body is in the source owner. Elaborated telescope and kernel/native/project acceptance are unavailable.", "theorem wheelRoot_mem_cycleDual (m : Nat) (hm : 3 ≤ m) (s : Finset (Label m)) :\n    s ∈ wheelRoot m (by omega) ↔\n      s ⊆ ground m ∧ ground m \\ s ∉ cycleIndependentOn m hm", DescribeRole.Theorem),
